@startuml audit-design
!include _style.puml
title Playground Audit: ports and adapters (partly built, mostly planned)
' palette: boundary=blue · service=green · domain=amber · port=lavender · adapter/infra=gray
' Shows the Audit hexagon (decision 14): the entry, the use case service, the port, the adapter, the two bridges.
' BUILT today, inside Access: the audit_entries table, the SqlAudit adapter, the AuditLog port and GET /audit.
' PLANNED: everything drawn here as its own context, the kind and details columns, the names and emails at the
' time, the two bridges, the Alembic migration, and the project entries. Boxes marked planned do not exist yet.
' Not drawn: the Access and Projects services that call their AuditLog ports (see access-design.puml and the
' Projects diagram), and the web page that shows the trail.
' The bridges sit in the composition root (main.py), the one place that knows Access, Projects and Audit.

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam linetype ortho
top to bottom direction

class "«entity, planned»\nAuditEntry" as AE #FFE6CC {
  at
  actor (id, name, email)
  action
  kind (account, project)
  target (id, name, email)
  details (people involved)
  reason
}

class "«service, planned»\nAuditService" as SVC #E7F4EA {
  +record(entry)
  +read(caller)
}

class "«port, built as AuditLog»\nAuditRepository" as PAR #EEE7F7 {
  +add(entry)
  +list_newest_first()
}

class "«adapter, built»\nSqlAudit" as SQL #EEE7F7

class "RDS PostgreSQL\naudit_entries" as DB #ECECEC

package "Composition root (main.py)" {
  class "«adapter, planned»\nAccessAuditBridge" as BA #EEE7F7
  class "«adapter, planned»\nProjectsAuditBridge" as BP #EEE7F7
}

class "«port»\nAccess AuditLog\n(built)" as PAL #EEE7F7
class "«port»\nProjects AuditLog\n(planned)" as PPL #EEE7F7

AE <.. SVC : builds, reads
SVC --> PAR
PAR <|.. SQL
SQL --> DB : AWS, RDS\nPostgreSQL
BA --> SVC : record
BP --> SVC : record
PAL <|.. BA
PPL <|.. BP

note right of SVC
  read(caller) lets
  only an administrator in.
  The trail is append only.
end note
note right of AE
  Names and emails are
  copied in when it happens.
end note
@enduml
